WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,210
This place is so well decorated

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:04,210
It must cost a lot of money

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,210
Does this entire estate belong to your family?

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,210
Even Mr. Lu’s name was pronounced correctly.

5
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:10,210
Not only vulgar, but also uncultured

6
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:12,210
Why the hell would he think Mr. Lu is Miko’s boyfriend?

7
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:14,210
It seems that he usually looks aloof and innocent.

8
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:15,210
It's all pretend

9
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:17,200
You see

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,200
I didn't lie to you

11
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Miko has a mother like this

12
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,260
Is he really as innocent as you think, aunt?

13
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,260
This manor does belong to my family

14
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,260
But I'm not a deer spirit

15
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,260
I am Lu Ling’s good friend Qi Luo

16
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,260
Sorry sorry

17
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,260
Auntie recognized the wrong person

18
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:35,020
Who is Lu Ling’s big friend?

19
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:38,020
The one on the main seat is Lu Ling

20
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:39,020
I can sit in the main seat a long time ago

21
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,020
I want to give it to the girl and say that he is rich and should be from the Lu family.

22
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:43,020
He looks like Tang Shuai

23
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,020
It's just that he looks a bit unfilial and fierce.

24
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,020
Doesn’t look easy to mess with

25
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:49,480
You are my Keke’s boyfriend.

26
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,580
I heard that your family is also quite wealthy.

27
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:54,730
Does your family have a manor?

28
00:00:54,730 --> 00:00:56,730
If I deny it in front of so many people

29
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:58,920
He and his mother will definitely not be able to get off stage.

30
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,920
Hello aunt

31
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,950
My family does have a manor

32
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:02,950
But abroad

33
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:03,950
Not available in China
